OL,3,GNEWSABridge reopening date set five
OL,4,Ayears after boat crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening of a road bridge over the
OL,7,FRiver Thames has been delayed, five
OL,8,Fyears after a boat struck a water main
OL,9,Funderneath the structure.
OL,11,FThames Water, which is leading the
OL,12,Fproject to repair Osney Bridge in
OL,13,FOxford, had initially planned to
OL,14,Fcomplete its repairs by 28 August.
OL,16,FThe water firm extended this deadline
OL,17,Fby two weeks last month, but now says
OL,18,F"structural complications" meant it
OL,19,Fwould aim to have the bridge ready to
OL,20,Freopen in time for 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
